    "description": "What: CE-2476 perception suite P7 (Sensing \u00a78.6e) - on bt-range a 'Red Walker' crosses open ground 20 m in front of two passive Blue listeners, then walks behind House A and stops there out of their sight. Judge: he is identified while he crosses (within the sighting dwell); once hidden he is REMEMBERED for a while (a man does not forget an enemy who ducked out of sight) and FORGOTTEN once the memory fades (~70 s), not before 20 s. Fail: never identified, dropped the moment he hides, or held for ever. Check: scripts/scenario-regression.sh pe-seen-then-hidden"
